[{"id":2612036707,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6bsIRj","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?u=8dcac36292a4d372c5b114dda5daaf4dfdbbc579&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102765#pullrequestreview-2612036707","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102765","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102765#pullrequestreview-2612036707"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102765"}},"submitted_at":"2025-02-12T14:06:41Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2616426420,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6b83-0","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?u=1b0467024f137e562b21748eb6bf12f97dfa5bf6&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I don't think this change is correct. The C# types are just converting the `Variant` elements to `T` every time an element is added/removed/accessed from the collection, the underlying type stored is still `Variant`.\r\n\r\nTo be clear about what the documentation was saying:\r\n\r\n> Typed wrapper around Godot's Array class, an array of Variant typed elements allocated in the engine in C+++.\r\n\r\nThis is describing the native C++ `Array` type that the C# type is a wrapper of. Even when the array is typed, the underlying storage is still `Variant` (`TypedArray<int32_t>` stores the `int32_t` elements as `Variant`).\r\n\r\nThis is different from packed arrays that actually store the element they are specifically designed to hold. For example, a `PackedByteArray` stores the elements as `byte`. As a result `PackedByteArray` can take less memory than `PackedInt32Array`, but `TypedArray<uint8_t>` and `TypedArray<int32_t>` will both take the same memory.\r\n\r\nCommon C# collection types such as `List<T>` or `T[]` work more like packed arrays in this sense, so I can see where the confusion may be coming from, but this is also why I think it's important to mention explicitly in the documentation that the elements are stored as `Variant` and not `T`. And all of this also applies to dictionaries.\r\n\r\nPerhaps there's a better way to describe how these types work, but it should still be clear that the underlying type stored is `Variant` even if conceptually it feels like they store `T` elements.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102765#pullrequestreview-2616426420","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102765","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102765#pullrequestreview-2616426420"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102765"}},"submitted_at":"2025-02-13T23:22:13Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2671828364,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6fQN2M","user":{"login":"paulloz","id":437025,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNzAyNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/437025?u=6af868897c2402f656706370263af6cd158525ef&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz","html_url":"https://github.com/paulloz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Looks good to me 👍 ","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102765#pullrequestreview-2671828364","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102765","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102765#pullrequestreview-2671828364"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102765"}},"submitted_at":"2025-03-10T18:11:41Z","commit_id":"288e3e3af2ab1aff10035eb72b23628568541883"}]